# Generated store output. `Store assets/` above is a different directory and
# never matched the path the capture script and runbook actually use, so the
# screenshots and any built APK were not being ignored and could be committed by
# accident. Both spellings are listed deliberately.
store-assets/
*.apk
*.aab
